        "state": "Mini Round Clock"
      }
    ],
    "content": "The **alarm** sounds until it is cancelled \u2014 the dismiss button above, saying *stop the timer*, or starting another one.\n\n**Clock shows it for** is only how long the ring and the screen keep flashing if nothing cancels it. A cancel clears them instantly either way. Set it to 0 and the lights last exactly as long as the sound."
